// Signing configuration.
//
// Device builds need a DEVELOPMENT_TEAM, but this is a public repo and a team id is a
// personal identifier, so the value lives in an untracked file beside this one.
//
// Create `Signing.local.xcconfig` with:
//
//     DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOURTEAMID
//
// `#include?` is the optional form: a fresh clone without that file still generates and
// still builds for the simulator. Only device builds need it, and they fail with Xcode's
// own "requires a development team" message, which is a clear enough signpost.
//
// This exists because `xcodegen generate` overwrites the project, so a team id set in
// Xcode's Signing & Capabilities editor survives only until the next regeneration —
// which is why CLAUDE.md forbids setting it there.
#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
